msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"In this game, there are three home run targets. Every target awards the "
"same amount of points. Once a target is hit, you cannot hit it again until "
"you hit all of the remaining targets."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid ""
"Aim by moving the cursor to where you want the ball to go. Use the "
"<Action:Button_LS_Up@Battingcenter><Action:Button_LS_"
"Down@Battingcenter><Action:Button_LS_Left@Battingcenter><Action:Button_LS_"
"Right@Battingcenter> to move the cursor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid ""
"Once you hit all the targets, a bonus target will appear. However, you only "
"get one chance to hit it. The bonus target disappears after one pitch, "
"whether you hit it or not. Aim carefully and go for a new high score!"
msgstr ""

